    iko:sourcePage 16 ;
    iko:sourceQuote "If your car is accidentally damaged, we can choose to either: > Repair – we’ll repair the damage ourselves or pay to repair it. > Replace – we’ll replace whatever is lost or damaged, if that’s more cost-effective. > Repay – we’ll settle your claim by sending a payment." .

iko:passage_cb79e63f5bdbb7b69f6f a iko:SourcePassage ;
    iko:sourceDocumentId "aviva_car_policy.pdf" ;
    iko:sourcePage 8 ;
    iko:sourceQuote "If your vehicle is lost, stolen, or damaged, we will: • repair your vehicle unless you notify us that you want us to pay someone else to repair it; or • pay you a cash amount equal to the loss or damage" .

iko:passage_eb57e9f755ee862b5f0b a iko:SourcePassage ;
    iko:sourceDocumentId "admiral_car_policy.pdf" ;
    iko:sourcePage 14 ;
    iko:sourceQuote "If your vehicle is lost or damaged due to: y an accident y vandalism y fire or lightning y theft or attempted theft you will be covered for damage to: y your vehicle" .

